<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Regulation lims:pit-date="2026-06-22" hasPreviousVersion="true" lims:lastAmendedDate="2026-06-22" lims:current-date="2026-07-21" lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418599" lims:id="1418599" gazette-part="II" regulation-type="SOR" xml:lang="en" xmlns:lims="http://justice.gc.ca/lims"><Identification lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418600" lims:id="1418600"><InstrumentNumber>SOR/2023-160</InstrumentNumber><RegistrationDate><Date><YYYY>2023</YYYY><MM>7</MM><DD>7</DD></Date></RegistrationDate><ConsolidationDate><Date><YYYY>2026</YYYY><MM>7</MM><DD>22</DD></Date></ConsolidationDate><EnablingAuthority lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418601" lims:id="1418601"><XRefExternal reference-type="act" link="C-54.011">CUSTOMS TARIFF</XRefExternal></EnablingAuthority><LongTitle lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418602" lims:id="1418602">Certain Russian Goods Remission Order</LongTitle><RegulationMakerOrder><RegulationMaker>P.C.</RegulationMaker><OrderNumber>2023-712</OrderNumber><Date><YYYY>2023</YYYY><MM>7</MM><DD>6</DD></Date></RegulationMakerOrder></Identification><Order lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418603" lims:id="1418603"><Provision lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418604" lims:id="1418604" format-ref="indent-0-0" language-align="yes" list-item="no"><Text>Her Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Finance, makes the annexed <XRefExternal reference-type="regulation" link="SOR-2023-160">Certain Russian Goods Remission Order</XRefExternal> under section 115<FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-5155_hq_1684856422">a</FootnoteRef> of the <XRefExternal reference-type="act" link="C-54.011">Customs Tariff</XRefExternal><FootnoteRef idref="fn_81000-2-5155_hq_1684856431">b</FootnoteRef>.</Text><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-5155_hq_1684856422" placement="page" status="official"><Label>a</Label><Text>S.C. 2005, c. 38, par. 145(2)(j)</Text></Footnote><Footnote id="fn_81000-2-5155_hq_1684856431" placement="page" status="official"><Label>b</Label><Text>S.C. 1997, c. 36</Text></Footnote></Provision></Order><Body lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418605" lims:id="1418605"><Heading lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418606" lims:id="1418606" level="1"><TitleText>Remission and Condition</TitleText></Heading><Section lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:lastAmendedDate="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1418607" lims:id="1593101"><MarginalNote lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593102" lims:id="1593102">Remission</MarginalNote><Label>1</Label><Text>Remission is granted of the customs duties paid or payable under the <XRefExternal reference-type="act" link="C-54.011">Customs Tariff</XRefExternal> in respect of the following goods that originate in Russia:</Text><Paragraph lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593103" lims:id="1593103"><Label>(a)</Label><Text>goods that are classified under tariff item No. 2844.43.00 and that are imported during the period beginning on October 8, 2022 and ending on July 7, 2028; and</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593104" lims:id="1593104"><Label>(b)</Label><Text>goods that are classified under tariff item No. 8807.20.00 and that are imported during the period beginning on March 2, 2022 and ending on April 16, 2029.</Text></Paragraph><HistoricalNote><HistoricalNoteSubItem lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593100" lims:id="1593100" lims:enactId="1590064">SOR/2026-140, s. 1</HistoricalNoteSubItem></HistoricalNote></Section><Section lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:lastAmendedDate="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1418609" lims:id="1418609"><MarginalNote lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418610" lims:id="1418610">Condition</MarginalNote><Label>2</Label><Subsection lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593109" lims:id="1593109"><Label>(1)</Label><Text>Remission is granted on condition that a claim for remission is made to the Minister of Public Safety and Emergency Preparedness within two years after the day on which the goods are imported.</Text></Subsection><Subsection lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593110" lims:id="1593110"><MarginalNote lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593111" lims:id="1593111">Exception</MarginalNote><Label>(2)</Label><Text>Despite subsection (1), in the case of goods referred to in paragraph (1)(b) that were imported before the day on which this subsection comes into force, remission is granted on condition that a claim for remission is made to the Minister of Public Safety and Emergency Preparedness within two years after that day.</Text></Subsection><HistoricalNote><HistoricalNoteSubItem lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1593106" lims:id="1593106" lims:enactId="1590069">SOR/2026-140, s. 2</HistoricalNoteSubItem></HistoricalNote></Section><Heading lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418611" lims:id="1418611" level="1"><TitleText>Repeal</TitleText></Heading><Section lims:inforce-start-date="2026-06-22" lims:enacted-date="2026-06-22" lims:lastAmendedDate="2026-06-22" lims:fid="1418612" lims:id="1593112" type="amending"><Label>3</Label><Text>[Amendments]</Text></Section><Heading lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418613" lims:id="1418613" level="1"><TitleText>Coming into Force</TitleText></Heading><Section lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:lastAmendedDate="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418614" lims:id="1418614" type="CIF"><MarginalNote lims:inforce-start-date="2023-07-07" lims:enacted-date="2023-07-07" lims:fid="1418615" lims:id="1418615">Registration</MarginalNote><Label>4</Label><Text>This Order comes into force on the day on which it is registered.</Text></Section></Body><Schedule id="NifProvs"><ScheduleFormHeading type="amending"><TitleText>AMENDMENTS NOT IN FORCE</TitleText></ScheduleFormHeading><RegulationPiece><RelatedOrNotInForce><Heading level="5" style="nifrp"><TitleText>
                    — SOR/2026-140, ss. 1(2)</TitleText></Heading><Section type="amending"><Label>1</Label><Subsection type="amending"><Label>(2)</Label><Text>Section 1 of the Order is replaced by the following:</Text><AmendedText><Section><MarginalNote>Remission</MarginalNote><Label>1</Label><Text>Remission is granted of the customs duties paid or payable under the <XRefExternal reference-type="act" link="C-54.011">Customs Tariff</XRefExternal> in respect of goods that are classified under tariff item No. 8807.20.00 that originate in Russia and that are imported during the period beginning on March 2, 2022 and ending on April 16, 2029.</Text></Section></AmendedText></Subsection></Section></RelatedOrNotInForce><RelatedOrNotInForce><Heading level="5" style="nifrp"><TitleText>
                    — SOR/2026-140, ss. 2(2)</TitleText></Heading><Section type="amending"><Label>2</Label><Subsection type="amending"><Label>(2)</Label><Text>Subsection 2(2) of the Order is repealed.</Text></Subsection></Section></RelatedOrNotInForce></RegulationPiece></Schedule><RecentAmendments><Amendment><AmendmentCitation>SOR/2026-140</AmendmentCitation><AmendmentDate>2026-06-22</AmendmentDate></Amendment></RecentAmendments></Regulation>